  "scope": "All twelve production base images and twenty production contract-state images independently viewed in both themes at desktop/mobile sizes. Sixteen distinct base controls and the complete five-state contract matrix were checked against actual structured results. This is a production pixel review, not full closeout or public launch approval.",
