    "Recovery-checkpoint getter denial visibly shows the correct refusal, retry and saved-franchise actions with readable text at both viewport sizes; client is not Ready while optional journey instrumentation remains usable.",
    "Optional journey quota failure reaches Ready and displays a fully framed usable tutorial; all choices and Skip Tutorial fit the mobile capture.",
    "Retained depth-chart mark is visibly done, with readable 1 of 5 · this tab only; structured Inbox controls return one item.",
    "Dismissal and completion revisit intentionally hide the isolated contract panel, revealing actual Desk content. First completion displays Contract honoured · this tab only once.",
    "Both finalized captures retain Season 2026: 5 of 5 met · this tab only; structured initial/later finalized objects match despite 2027 input.",
    "No horizontal clipping of the changed contract title/status or recovery actions. Desktop captures show all five rows; mobile captures show the status and first three rows clearly."
